==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Pronunciation===
*{{rhymes|ɒnsəl}}
{{rfp}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|tonsill|lang=la}}, compare French {{term|tonsille|lang=fr}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|anatomy|immunology}} Either of a pair of small [[mass]]es of [[lymphoid]] [[tissue]] that lie on each side of the [[throat]] and that help [[protect]] the body against [[infection]].

